@api = http://localhost:5080/api/v1
@venue = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Nearby venues (Sukhumvit 39)
GET {{api}}/venues?lat=13.7317&lng=100.5700&radiusKm=5&from=17:00&to=22:00

### Venue detail
GET {{api}}/venues/racquet-club-sukhumvit-49

### Availability
GET {{api}}/venues/{{venue}}/availability

### Request OTP (dev returns devCode)
POST {{api}}/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "0812345678" }

### Verify OTP -> copy accessToken
POST {{api}}/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "0812345678", "code": "000000" }
